{"assets":["/statement-assets/8dbe1519cf6e43b94ed24befed6bd4adda079a48fa5f43eb3b265dceb3a66bab.png","/statement-assets/35642f1faa91211aa983fd94ec57f4c08d5984fd48358240285203c316052fa8.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1767","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Cut the Triangle"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given a non-degenerate triangle (a non-degenerate triangle is a triangle with positive area). The vertices of the triangle have coordinates $$$(x_1, y_1)$$$, $$$(x_2, y_2)$$$ and $$$(x_3, y_3)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You want to draw a straight line to cut the triangle into "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"two non-degenerate triangles"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". Furthermore, the line you draw should be "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"either horizontal or vertical"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Can you draw the line to meet all the constraints?"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here are some suitable ways to draw the line:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/8dbe1519cf6e43b94ed24befed6bd4adda079a48fa5f43eb3b265dceb3a66bab.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"However, these ways to draw the line are not suitable (the first line cuts the triangle into a triangle and a quadrangle; the second line doesn't cut the triangle at all; the third line is neither horizontal nor vertical):"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/35642f1faa91211aa983fd94ec57f4c08d5984fd48358240285203c316052fa8.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test case consists of four lines. The first of them is empty. The $$$i$$$-th of the next three lines contains two integers $$$x_i$$$ and $$$y_i$$$ ($$$1 \\le x_i, y_i \\le 10^8$$$) — the coordinates of the $$$i$$$-th vertex of the triangle."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Additional constraint on the input: in each test case, the triangle formed by three vertices has positive area (i. e. it is non-degenerate)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if it is possible to cut the triangle according to the statement, or "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" otherwise. You may print each letter in any case ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"YES"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Yes"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" will all be recognized as positive answer, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"NO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"no"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nO"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" will all be recognized as negative answer)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n\n4 7\n6 8\n3 5\n\n4 5\n4 7\n6 8\n\n5 8\n1 8\n2 5\n\n3 6\n6 6\n6 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\nYES\nYES\nYES\nNO\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1767A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1767/problem/A"}